<sheets>
<sheet><plain>
<text x="0" y="20.32" size="3.0" layer="97">STAND-ALONE KEYER - sheet 1/2: power, PIC, paddle, key out, controls  (draft 1, 2026-11-05)</text>
<text x="0" y="6.35" size="2.1844" layer="97">POWER - 9 V battery</text>
<text x="0" y="-66.04" size="1.524" layer="97">Q1: reverse-battery protection (body diode, then the FET turns on).</text>
<text x="0" y="-68.58" size="1.524" layer="97">VSENSE = VBAT x 0.32 (9.5 V -&gt; 3.0 V; LB 6.5 V; stop 5.8 V).</text>
<text x="119.38" y="6.35" size="2.1844" layer="97">PIC16F18326 KEYER</text>
<text x="157.48" y="-38.1" size="1.524" layer="97">C5 close to U2 pin 1</text>
<text x="162.56" y="-68.58" size="1.524" layer="97">J8 pin 6: not connected</text>
<text x="241.3" y="6.35" size="2.1844" layer="97">KEY OUT - isolated (modern rigs: 60 V / 100 mA)</text>
<text x="259.08" y="-48.26" size="1.524" layer="97">Tip = key, ring = PTT / amp, sleeve = common.</text>
<text x="259.08" y="-50.8" size="1.524" layer="97">KEY_COM is NOT connected to the keyer GND.</text>
<text x="0" y="-78.74" size="2.1844" layer="97">PADDLE IN</text>
<text x="76.2" y="-109.22" size="1.524" layer="97">U3 sits at the jack (ESD).</text>
<text x="0" y="-139.7" size="1.524" layer="97">Tip = dit, ring = dah (swapped by the reverse setting).</text>
<text x="116.84" y="-88.9" size="2.1844" layer="97">CONTROLS (panel parts on headers)</text>
<text x="175.26" y="-129.54" size="1.524" layer="97">Q2: LM386 power, off while the keyer is idle (AMP_EN low = on).</text>
</plain><instances>
