<sheet><plain>
<text x="-15.24" y="20.32" size="3.0" layer="97">STAND-ALONE KEYER - sheet 2/2: sidetone, LM386, audio switch  (draft 1, 2026-11-05)</text>
<text x="-15.24" y="6.35" size="2.1844" layer="97">SIDETONE (as Rev 2 sheet 2; LM386 on switched 5 V)</text>
<text x="111.76" y="12.7" size="1.778" layer="97">LM386 gain network (as Rev 2)</text>
<text x="177.8" y="6.35" size="1.778" layer="97">AMP SUPPLY DECOUPLING</text>
<text x="-15.24" y="-63.5" size="2.1844" layer="97">AUDIO SWITCH: sidetone or rig audio to the phones</text>
<text x="-15.24" y="-152.4" size="1.524" layer="97">U8 is normally closed: rig audio passes with its LED off (no current).</text>
<text x="-15.24" y="-154.94" size="1.524" layer="97">Firmware (stand-alone): RX_CW high = rig audio on, low = muted while sending.</text>
</plain><instances>
